Dawnmonger is an inventor who travels with [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]], [[People/Althane/Henrik|Henrik]] and [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] as [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. He builds and repairs machines, and wears a pair of rocket boots he made himself. He carries the [[Phenomena/Althane/Godpiercer|godpiercer]] the Weft had made in [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin/index|the lava ruin]].
